      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "1. 核心原则"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8ed8880121c4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 607,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 当前以本地优先方式运行。核心档案数据",
        "默认保存在用户设备上，产品设计优先让保存",
        "、检索、备份和多数组织逻辑在本地完成。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-191ee4f913a7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 716,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "2. AI 相关数据使用"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-921343ee7d7e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.016",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 779,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 不默认把完整档案交给外部 AI。需要调用",
        "外部 AI 的功能，应由用户明确触发，并尽量只",
        "处理完成当前任务所必要的内容。AI Context ",
        "的授权、排除和预览应当先由用户确认。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9306fadd295d",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 915,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "3. 本网站"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-565b982b470b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 978,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "当前公开展示网站不连接用户的 PAIA 档案，也",
        "不设置分析脚本或行为跟踪器。网站仅用于说",
        "明产品理念、交互与当前开发状态。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-461a71d16c12",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1087,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "4. Private Beta 申请"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5c1320d97a64",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Private Beta 申请表通过第三方表单转发服务 F",
        "ormSubmit 将你主动填写的信息发送到项目联",
        "系邮箱 haohongfei2001@gmail.com。申请信",
        "息仅用于当前 Beta 的招募、筛选与联系，并会",
        "在不再需要用于 Beta 招募后删除。你可以随时",
        "通过项目联系邮箱要求提前删除已提交的申请",
        "信息。请不要提交敏感信息。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5b22adb740fa",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1367,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "5. Private Beta"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9eca3203f5f5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 仍处于 Private Beta。具体数据结构、同",
        "步方式和可选 AI 功能可能继续调整。若未来引",
        "入云同步、账户系统或新的外部服务，会在正",
        "式启用前更新本政策并说明相应数据边界。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-ff4b868c4e46",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.023",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1566,
      "width": 334,
