      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "6. 用户控制与删除"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-c1312124249f",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy-policy-zh-390.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1629,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "产品目标是让用户保留对自己档案的最终控制",
        "权，包括查看、编辑、导出和删除。具体能力",
        "以当前 Beta 版本实际提供的功能为准。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-615c608d6130",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
